Package: jde-opchub
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: ca-certificates
Suggests: nginx
Homepage: https://github.com/Jde-cpp/opc-hub
Description: Jde OpcHub - OPC UA gateway with a REST/WebSocket API
 The AppServer and the OPC gateway in one process (jde-opchub.service, port
 1967, its OPC UA endpoint on opc.tcp 4841), Jde's own OPC UA server
 (jde-opcserver.service - opc.tcp 4840, http 1970 - installed but not
 enabled) and the Angular Web UI under /opt/jde-cpp/web for an nginx site.
 The database is sqlite, one file per product under /var/lib/Jde-Cpp,
 created on the first start.
